/738190/extras/b9aad7f6cebbee4fbfdaaa7e325c53c1.avif?t=1634061963\" width=460 height=214 /></span><br><br><strong>features</strong><br><br>*Classic choose-your-own-adventure gameplay <br>*Chiptune Soundtrack <br>*Skill-check systems allows for varied gameplay<br>*Solve a Medieval Mystery!",
